收季到来，在中央水洗处理站附近岛上种植的咖农们划着小船将新鲜的咖啡鲜果送到处理站来，也可以选择交到中央鲜果收集处。处理站设有若干个干燥棚架和水洗池，在这里可以在水洗处理之后马上进行遮阴晾干，并进行挑选工作。第二天，咖啡会被移至晾晒床上，继续进行人工手选，在干燥过程的每一天都会进行，确保可见的瑕疵被去除。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SnlODiaTrnTuwU9kZrhghs3px7RDticvubmH44yQ7HWeNzMnAFGlqrwGmDUChiaBoEicdxibRyGe2NWOg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Rl5Z6sc9s3RPmvfrYktDRMWBuu0oW6vDRPBgVOnzQxiaZJiaiaAElxicDDRSQb3rSNY4piaLOL4nlPOxg/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;width: 140px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          淘宝\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          注意：先1元入会完成交易后，再领券消费哈\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q8gztY40VA89LGDdb23gg3bT3s8azp51FtLnHJWNg6Gn8Uw1Bib90OF2da4tHsJMYNEkul7icKibic0w/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;width: 240px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          有赞\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=